# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF line endings, whatever the machine's git
# settings, so tools that parse files with \n (frontmatter regexes, generators) behave the same on
# Windows, macOS, Linux and CI. Git detects binary files itself; the list below just makes the
# common ones explicit.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
*.tgz binary
